  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vE3eal-TyMY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p>\n<p><span>您是否曾嘗試遊玩極難模式的模組？您可能在幾秒內就會陣亡。一步踏錯便是終局。這可能會讓人相當沮喪，尤其是當您和朋友一起玩的時候。您可能希望挑戰高難度，但不想這麼殘酷吧？PlayerRevive 是個不錯的折衷方案。它允許在玩家死亡後的 60 秒內將其復活。愚蠢的失誤絕不應成為您的終點。現在，這取決於您的朋友了。</span></p>\n<p>建議安裝 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/enhancedvisuals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnhancedVisuals</a>，以獲得更宏大且刺激的體驗。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">正在尋找與好友同樂的伺服器嗎？我們的贊助商為您提供完善支援：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fimages%252flogos%252fdark_text%25401538x500.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png</a>)](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/teamcreative</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用優惠碼 **teamcreative**，即可在任意遊戲伺服器首月獲得 25% 折扣優惠！</p>\n<p><strong>不相容項目</strong></p>\n<p>1.12：PotionCore：請確認將「Fix Effects When Changing Dimensions」設定為 false。</p>\n<p><strong>外掛模組</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-sbw-playerrevive-gun-mod-compitability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[TaCZ/SBW] PlayerRevive 槍械模組相容性</a></p>\n<p><strong>音樂</strong></p>\n<p>Zander Noriega - Perpetual Tension <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopengameart.org%252fcontent%252fperpetual-tension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopengameart.org%252fcontent%252fperpetual-tension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://opengameart.org/content/perpetual-tension</a><br>\nDream Raid - Matthew Pablo <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopengameart.org%252fcontent%252fdream-raid-cinematic-action-soundtrack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://opengameart.org/content/dream-raid-cinematic-action-soundtrack</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
